  "next_implementation_question": {
    "question": "Does composing the current exact paired NV decoder and M2/M3 K512 two-stage input ring with one Gate/Up-to-SiLU publication remove useful complete-API cost?",
    "lineage": "Old v33 already fused Gate/Up/SiLU with four warps per role. Its M3 used128registers and32000sharedbytes; it was neutral and removed. Plain fusion or another warp mapping is not new. Current admitted NV paired decoder and K512 input ring postdate v33, creating a materially changed coupled producer lifetime.",
