    "structural_resource_change": "For M3 a fixed shared K512 ring plus current 2048-byte codebooks and192-byte pair publication needs8384bytes, versus old32000. This is a source storage calculation, not compiled occupancy or speed. Current scalar pair decode/FMA trees and both BF16 intermediate rounding points remain required.",
    "guard": "One complete bounded composition only after declaring resource/correctness/API gates. Compare to v94 at real API; remove if neutral. No profiler extension or claim that smaller storage guarantees speed.",
